  "description": "<p>I'm a full-time TV music composer/producer for 22 years, and at the end of 2021, I started creating royalty-free Cinematic MIDI Packs.</p><p><br></p><p>These are highly useful tools for composers to get inspired, and jumpstart their compositions, having access to the same streamlined writing I use for my own personal TV music compositions that have earned 6-figures for over 20 years. They are also great for educational purposes, in that they provide a behind-the-curtain look at exactly what is being played and what sounds are being used to achieve the end result.</p><p>These are the kind of products that I continue to create, so there is always something fresh coming to the store, and over 40 products to choose from so far. Many composers return over and over to refresh and update their MIDI Pack collection from Media Music Mastery.</p><p>Todd</p>",
